sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as API
    participant W as Worker
    C->>API: POST /reports
    API->>W: Enqueue job
    API-->>C: 202 Accepted + Location: /operations/42
    Note right of W: Process job
    C->>API: GET /operations/42
    API-->>C: 200 status: running + Retry-After: 5
    W->>API: Mark done
    C->>API: GET /operations/42
    API-->>C: 303 See Other + Location: /reports/9
    C->>API: GET /reports/9
    API-->>C: 200 report
